OL,3,GNEWSAVerdict delayed on controversial
OL,4,Asea defences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA verdict has not been reached over
OL,7,Fwhether controversial coastal defences
OL,8,Fwill be built in Blackpool.
OL,10,FCouncillors have deferred a major
OL,11,Fplanning application for 17 groynes
OL,12,Fafter the RNLI made a formal objection
OL,13,Fto building of the groynes in April.
OL,15,FThe charity previously claimed the
OL,16,Fcouncil had ignored safety issues they
OL,17,Fhad flagged, such as increased risk to
OL,18,Ftourists and rescue crews.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
