OL,3,GNEWSAVerdict delayed on controversial
OL,4,Asea defences
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool Council has a statutory duty
OL,7,Fto deliver schemes to protect the
OL,8,Fcoastline. It said if the proposals
OL,9,Ffall through, a new scheme would
OL,10,Frequire a council contribution of #13m
OL,11,Fdue to changes in government funding.
